# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent) and ruling TC (places counted as built): the counter's label is 0; the loud arm builds 1, so the button is 2; the soft arm builds none, so it is 1.
test loud

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="total 0")
    1: Ui.Label(text="x")
    2: Ui.Button(label="go")

tick 1
  in:
    2: click
  changed:
    0: Ui.Label(text="total 10")

test soft

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="total 0")
    1: Ui.Button(label="go")

tick 1
  in:
    1: click
  changed:
    0: Ui.Label(text="total 20")
